        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2) 偏角の差を整数倍する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "商の偏角を整理し、そのn倍がπの整数倍となる最小の自然数nを探します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
