          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(4) 終了時刻の確率を隣同士で比べる",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "n回目で10個目の1が出るには、最初のn−1回に1が9回、n回目に1が出ればよいです。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "p_n={}_{n-1}C_9\\left(\\frac16\\right)^{10}\\left(\\frac56\\right)^{n-10}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "p(n+1)/p(n)が1をまたぐ場所を調べると、最大となる最小のnは54です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "n=54",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "fujita-health-2025-general-early-mathematics-answers-p004",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(5) 有理化した後に負の符号を見る",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\sqrt{4x^2+x}+2x",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "=\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{4x^2+x}-2x}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "x→−∞では√(x²)=−xです。符号を落とさず極限を取ると−1/4です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "-\\frac14",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(6) 差を1項目から足す",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "a_n=1+\\sum_{k=1}^{n-1}(k^2-k)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "一般項と2025を比較すると、初めて超える項番号は20です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "n=20",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "fujita-health-2025-general-early-mathematics-answers-p005",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(7) 直角三角形の角度を追う",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "長さの等しい部分と直角条件を図に書き込み、相似な三角形から角を移します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\angle PRQ=135^\\circ",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q1-7-geometry",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(8) 3^x−3^(−x)を一つの文字へ置く",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "t=3^x−3^(−x)と置きます。xがすべての実数を動くとき、tもすべての実数を動きます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "t=3^x-3^{-x}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "元の式はt²+3t+2です。平方完成すると、t=−3/2で最小値−1/4を取ります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "t^2+3t+2=\\left(t+\\frac32\\right)^2-\\frac14",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "-\\frac14",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q1-8-graphs",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "fujita-health-2025-general-early-mathematics-answers-p006",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(9) 平均からのずれを平方する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\bar{x}=\\frac{161+185+163+179+167}{5}=171",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "V=\\frac{1}{5}\\sum_{i=1}^{5}(x_i-171)^2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "V=88",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "第1問の確認",
            "text": "分数の符号、指数置換のt>0、分散で5個の平均を取ることを見直します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "fujita-health-2025-general-early-mathematics-answers-p007",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第2問　共通接線を接触条件から作る",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1) 接点を文字で置く",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "C1とC2の接点で、接線の傾きと切片が同じになる条件を立てます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "C_1:y=x^2+2(k+1)x+4k+3",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "C_2:y=x^2+2(k-1)x-4k+3",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "条件を整理すると共通接線は次の式です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\ell:y=-2kx-4k^2+2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q2-parabolas",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "fujita-health-2025-general-early-mathematics-answers-p008",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2) 上側の曲線が変わる点で分ける",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "接点と2放物線の交点を求め、各区間で上側の放物線から接線を引きます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "接線との差は平方の形になるので、区間ごとに積分すると計算が安定します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "S=\\int_{-2k-1}^{-2k}(C_1-\\ell)\\,dx",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "+\\int_{-2k}^{-2k+1}(C_2-\\ell)\\,dx",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "原本の区間で評価すると、kに依存せず面積は2/3です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "S=\\frac23",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "fujita-health-2025-general-early-mathematics-answers-p009",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "記述答案の形",
            "text": "接点条件、共通接線、交点、積分区間、面積の順に書きます。式だけでなく、どの曲線との差を積分したかを一言添えます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第3問　大小関係を確定して2^mをくくる",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "整数条件を整理してm,nが自然数であることを確かめます。次にn<mでは矛盾するため、n≥mと分かります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "n\\ge m",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "n−mが0以上なので2^mをくくれます。かっこ内は整数であり、2^mは4の正の約数です。したがってmは1または2に絞られます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "2^m\\left(3^m-2^{n-m}\\right)=4",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "fujita-health-2025-general-early-mathematics-answers-p010",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "解を尽くしたことを確認する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "m=1,2を元の式へ代入するとn=1,5です。2^mが4を割り切る条件で候補を尽くしているため、ほかの解はありません。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "6^1=2^1+4",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "6^2=2^5+4",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "(m,n)=(1,1),(2,5)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "最終確認",
            "text": "第2問と第3問は求める手順の説明が必要です。式の変形理由と、解を尽くした根拠を答案に残します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "人間確認待ち",
            "text": "この解説は原本の解法順と答えを維持した編集案です。科目担当者による数式・答案表現・戦略の最終確認が必要です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
